WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.000
Enabling available blocks lets editors change the body structure.

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:15.000
Disable the last available block: Primo confirms that the page type becomes static.

00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:22.000
Existing body sections remain. Editors can change content, but structure is fixed.

00:00:22.000 --> 00:00:29.000
Enable a block again to restore flexible layout controls, including reordering.

00:00:29.000 --> 00:00:36.000
This Blog Post type stays fixed: Post Content uses the first post’s own fields.

00:00:36.000 --> 00:00:43.000
Another post keeps the same structure, with its own title and body.
